# The link tracker runs on go.scottishkelly.uk. The apex is a static Cloudflare
# Pages site whose catch-all serves the homepage for ANY unknown path — so a
# tracking URL that lost its "go." prefix silently returned the homepage with
# no redirect and no click recorded. Danny hit exactly this on
# scottishkelly.uk/of/_pastelcloud (2026-09-25).
/of/*            https://go.scottishkelly.uk/of/:splat   302
/_pastelcloud    https://go.scottishkelly.uk/_pastelcloud   302
/sparklebush     https://go.scottishkelly.uk/sparklebush    302
/neonmiss        https://go.scottishkelly.uk/neonmiss       302
/mistyvale       https://go.scottishkelly.uk/mistyvale      302
/plushorbit      https://go.scottishkelly.uk/plushorbit     302
